; <rdar://problem/10368487> Contact problems if you have "siri" as user data
leading noise
    {嘿|嗨|喂|喂喂|唉|唉嗨|哈喽|哈罗|哈啰|你好|hello|hi|hey|yo|howdy|hola}{ }Siri [conf=vh][exists;constraint=start;strict=true]
    (嘿|嗨|喂|喂喂|唉|唉嗨|哈喽|哈罗|哈啰|你好|hello|hi|hey|yo|howdy|hola)
    {{可不}可以|{能不}能}(帮我|帮忙) [conf=vh]
    {{可不}可以|{能不}能}(请{你}|麻烦{你}|拜托{你}){帮我|帮忙}[conf=vh]
    ; 有xxxxxxx吗?
    有 [conf=high][exists="吗,么,咩,不,没有";constraint=end]

    哇 [exists;constraint=start;strict=true]

    ; the followings are for STT workaround
    ; <rdar://problem/29320633> [zh_CN][NL][Accuracy][Clustering] 嘿sorry -> 嘿Siri - Freq: 20K/Day
    (嘿|嗨|喂|喂喂|唉|唉嗨|哈喽|哈罗|哈啰|你好|hello|hi|hey|yo|howdy|hola){ }Sir [conf=vh][exists;constraint=start;strict=true]
    (嘿|嗨|喂|喂喂|唉|唉嗨|哈喽|哈罗|哈啰|你好|hello|hi|hey|yo|howdy|hola){ }Sorry [conf=vh][exists;constraint=start;strict=true]

    ; {hi|hey|hello|yo|g{'}day|good day|howdy|hola} {please|there} Siri {(can|will) you} {please} [conf=vh][exists;constraint=start;strict=true]
    ; {hi|hey|hello|yo|g{'}day|good day|howdy|hola}
    ; and
    ; but
    ; {no} i said
    ; (yes|yeah|yep|yup|sure)
    ; oh
    ; (yes|yeah|yep|yup|sure) but

;<rdar://problem/10287714> "I want a reminder please", "please" is used as the reminder topic
trailing noise [conf=vh]
    {可以|好|行}吗 [exists;constraint=end]
    好不好 [exists;constraint=end]
    Siri [exists;constraint=end]
    吧 [exists;constraint=end]
    啊 [exists;constraint=end]
    哇 [exists;constraint=end]
    呀 [exists;constraint=end]
    啦 [exists;constraint=end]

leading or trailing noise
    我是说
    我是问
    我说
    我说的是
    我问{你}的是
    我是问你
    我是指
    我指的是
    我的意思是
    我是让你
    请
    请问{{一}下}
    谢谢{你}
    麻烦{你}
    那
    Siri [conf=vh][notExists="的";constraint=adjAfter]

    {Siri}你{知不|是不是|会不会}知道

verb leading noise
    ; (can|will) you {please}
    ; (could|would) you {please}
    ; {do|would} you mind
    ; how about {you}
    ; {pretty} please
    ; why don't you
    ; {I} feel like
    ; {I('m| am)} feeling like
    ; {I('m| am)} in the mood (to|for)
    ; I (want|would like) {you} to

adjective
    好看
    值得推荐的好
    ; I don't want to generalize the case
;    <rdar://problem/24054319> [zh_CN][Books][NL][13E177-9K378] Incorrect result for 'any good books/show me some good books'
    ; best
    ; finest
    ; good
    ; great

profanity
